564	        <svg viewBox="0 0 900 195" role="img" aria-label="Loop-back diagram: proof loops back to canon on recurrence, lambda loops back to canon on contradiction, canon self-checks for drift, graph self-checks for duplicates. Full trigger conditions are in the table below.">
