648	      <div class="protocol">
649	        <div class="step"><div class="step-icon">01</div><div><b>canon</b> drafts + gates a spec<div class="note">research-report and tradeoffs attached, not just the passing criteria</div></div></div>
650	        <div class="step gate"><div class="step-icon">GATE</div><div><b>Publish spec + tradeoffs as an artifact</b><div class="note">short comparison table, not prose — sign-off before vector plans anything</div></div></div>
651	        <div class="step"><div class="step-icon">02</div><div><b>vector</b> plans + challenges<div class="note">interface-completeness check runs here</div></div></div>
652	        <div class="step gate"><div class="step-icon">GATE</div><div><b>Publish plan + task table as an artifact</b><div class="note">sign-off before lambda writes anything</div></div></div>
653	        <div class="step"><div class="step-icon">03</div><div><b>lambda → axiom → proof</b> run to completion<div class="note">no further pause — this part was already trustworthy</div></div></div>
654	      </div>
655	    </div>
656	  </section>
657	
658	  <section class="rail-section">
659	    <div class="rail"><span class="rail-num">07</span><span class="rail-label">Discipline</span></div>
660	    <div class="content">
661	      <h2>Token discipline</h2>
662	      <div class="discipline">
663	        <div class="rule"><div class="verb">Tables, not paragraphs</div><p>Tradeoffs as a comparison grid. Findings as criterion_id / type / fix rows, matching canon's existing issue format.</p></div>
664	        <div class="rule"><div class="verb">One diagram, not a narrative</div><p>A plan is a task list a human can scan in ten seconds — not a chat transcript reconstructed as prose.</p></div>
665	        <div class="rule"><div class="verb">Flag, don't restate</div><p>Checkpoint artifacts show deltas and open questions — never the full spec text the human already saw.</p></div>
666	      </div>
667	    </div>
668	  </section>
669	
670	</main>
671	
672	<footer class="closing">
673	  <div class="closing-inner">
674	    <div class="kicker">Next</div>
675	    <p class="ask">Pick a starting point — <span class="opt">vector:challenger</span>, <span class="opt">canon:audit-spec</span>, or <span class="opt">lambda</span>'s default posture — or pilot the two-gate checkpoint manually on the next spec before wiring any of it in.</p>
676	  </div>
677	</footer>
678	
679	<script>
680	  try { document.getElementById('dateline').textContent = new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10); } catch (e) {}
681	</script>
682	
683	</body></html>

